pa-220# help pa220
pa220 - PA-220 read-only maintenance information

Usage:
pa220 status  - show board, memory, network and CPLD status
pa220 env     - show environment storage and write warning
pa220 memory  - show load memory variables and __tmp_load block
pa220 board   - show cached board descriptor and MAC information
pa220 clock   - show initialized CORE, SCLK and DDR clock values
pa-220# pa220 board
Board type : 20021 (PA220)
Revision   : 1.1
Serial     : 012801031163
Descriptor : from initialized descriptor
MAC base   : 08:30:6b:e1:be:00
MAC count  : 255
Source note: MAC descriptor may be EEPROM data or generated fallback.
pa-220# pa220 clock
CORE clock : 1000000000 Hz (1000 MHz) [gd->cpu_clk]
SCLK clock : 500000000 Hz (500 MHz) [gd->bus_clk]
DDR clock  : 800000000 Hz (800 MHz base; 1600 MT/s DDR) [gd->mem_clk]
NOTE       : initialized global-data/configuration values, not independent measurements.
DDR source : valid EEPROM DDR clock descriptor, otherwise PA-220 fallback; source is not retained.
pa-220#
